{% comment %}
================================================================================
CZ Browse Products Webhook
================================================================================
PURPOSE: Fires on custom_product_view. Updates two user attributes:
  - recently_browsed_products  — rolling window of 8 unique in-stock products
  - browse_affinity_categories — product_type values sorted by view frequency

CANVAS: "CZ - Track Browse Products" — immediate re-entry, single Webhook step.

CANVAS ENTRY PROPERTIES (from custom_product_view event):
  canvas_entry_properties.sku               — "D140023-01"
  canvas_entry_properties.product_title     — "Vati Vase"
  canvas_entry_properties.image_url         — CDN image URL
  canvas_entry_properties.variant_url       — "https://www.the-citizenry.com/products/vati-vase?v=..."
  canvas_entry_properties.product_type      — "Accents" (the category)
  canvas_entry_properties.quantity_available — integer (OOS check)

CATALOG: the-citizenry_shopify_catalog (keyed by SKU)
  Fields used: shopify_product_id (dedup key), variant_image_url (image fallback only)
  NOTE: product_url is NOT pulled from catalog — variant_url from the event is used instead,
  so the email links back to the exact variant the user viewed.

ABORT CONDITIONS:
  - SKU not found in catalog (can't get shopify_product_id for deduplication)
  - quantity_available == 0 at time of view (exclude OOS products from window)

DEDUP LOGIC: By shopify_product_id. If a product was viewed before (even a
different variant mapping to the same product), the old entry is removed and
the new one appended as the most recent.

DROP LOGIC: When the array is at 8 items and the product is not a duplicate,
the oldest item (forloop.first = index 0) is dropped to make room for the new one.

ARRAY ORDER: Oldest at index 0, newest at the end. The email grid reads with
  | reverse | slice: 0, 8 to show newest first.

BRAZE WEBHOOK CONFIG:
  Method: POST
  URL:    https://rest.iad-06.braze.com/users/track  ← verify cluster for CZ workspace
  Headers:
    Authorization: Bearer YOUR_CZ_REST_API_KEY
    Content-Type: application/json
================================================================================
{% endcomment %}

{% assign max_items = 8 %}

{% comment %} ── Catalog lookup: SKU → shopify_product_id, product_url, image ── {% endcomment %}
{% catalog_items the-citizenry_shopify_catalog {{canvas_entry_properties.sku}} %}
{% assign catalog_item = items[0] %}

{% assign shopify_product_id = catalog_item.shopify_product_id | default: '' %}
{% assign fallback_image     = catalog_item.variant_image_url  | default: '' %}

{% comment %} ── Abort: SKU not in catalog (need product_id for dedup) ─────── {% endcomment %}
{% if shopify_product_id == blank %}
  {% abort_message('sku not in catalog') %}
{% endif %}

{% comment %} ── Abort: product out of stock at view time ───────────────────── {% endcomment %}
{% assign qty = canvas_entry_properties.quantity_available | default: 0 | plus: 0 %}
{% if qty == 0 %}
  {% abort_message('product out of stock at view time') %}
{% endif %}

{% comment %} ── Current product fields ────────────────────────────────────── {% endcomment %}
{% assign product_title = canvas_entry_properties.product_title | default: '' %}
{% assign image_url     = canvas_entry_properties.image_url     | default: fallback_image %}
{% assign url           = canvas_entry_properties.variant_url   | default: '' %}
{% assign product_type  = canvas_entry_properties.product_type  | default: '' %}
{% assign now_iso       = 'now' | date: '%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ' %}

{% comment %} ── Load existing array; check for duplicate shopify_product_id ── {% endcomment %}
{% assign existing_products = custom_attribute.${recently_browsed_products} | default: empty %}
{% assign duplicate_found = false %}
{% for item in existing_products %}
  {% if item.product_id == shopify_product_id %}{% assign duplicate_found = true %}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

{% comment %}
================================================================================
  PRE-COMPUTE: build the category list of the final array (kept items + new item).
  This mirrors the JSON-body loop below exactly, so browse_affinity_categories
  reflects the precise 8-item window that will be written to recently_browsed_products.
================================================================================
{% endcomment %}
{% assign ba_cats_line = '' %}
{% for item in existing_products %}
  {% unless item.product_id == shopify_product_id %}
    {% unless existing_products.size >= max_items and duplicate_found == false and forloop.first %}
      {% assign item_type = item.product_type | default: '' %}
      {% if ba_cats_line == '' %}
        {% assign ba_cats_line = item_type %}
      {% else %}
        {% assign ba_cats_line = ba_cats_line | append: '|||' | append: item_type %}
      {% endif %}
    {% endunless %}
  {% endunless %}
{% endfor %}
{% comment %} Add the incoming product's category {% endcomment %}
{% if ba_cats_line == '' %}
  {% assign ba_cats_line = product_type %}
{% else %}
  {% assign ba_cats_line = ba_cats_line | append: '|||' | append: product_type %}
{% endif %}

{% assign ba_cats_arr = ba_cats_line | split: '|||' %}

{% comment %} ── Unique categories (first-seen order, for tie-breaking) ──────── {% endcomment %}
{% assign ba_seen_cats = '::' %}
{% assign ba_unique_cats_line = '' %}
{% for cat in ba_cats_arr %}
  {% unless cat == blank %}
    {% assign cat_check = '::' | append: cat | append: '::' %}
    {% unless ba_seen_cats contains cat_check %}
      {% assign ba_seen_cats = ba_seen_cats | append: cat | append: '::' %}
      {% if ba_unique_cats_line == '' %}
        {% assign ba_unique_cats_line = cat %}
      {% else %}
        {% assign ba_unique_cats_line = ba_unique_cats_line | append: '|||' | append: cat %}
      {% endif %}
    {% endunless %}
  {% endunless %}
{% endfor %}
{% assign ba_unique_cats_arr = ba_unique_cats_line | split: '|||' %}

{% comment %}
  Sort unique categories by count descending (no | sort needed).
  Strategy: outer loop counts from 8 down to 1 (target 1..8 → check_count 8..1).
  For each count, emit categories that have exactly that count and haven't been
  emitted yet. Ties preserve first-seen order (insertion order of unique cats).
{% endcomment %}
{% assign ba_sorted_cats_json = '' %}
{% assign ba_sorted_seen = '::' %}
{% for target in (1..8) %}
  {% assign check_count = 9 | minus: target %}
  {% for ucat in ba_unique_cats_arr %}
    {% unless ucat == blank %}
      {% assign already_in = '::' | append: ucat | append: '::' %}
      {% unless ba_sorted_seen contains already_in %}
        {% assign this_count = 0 %}
        {% for c in ba_cats_arr %}
          {% if c == ucat %}{% assign this_count = this_count | plus: 1 %}{% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
        {% if this_count == check_count %}
          {% assign ba_sorted_seen = ba_sorted_seen | append: ucat | append: '::' %}
          {% assign cat_clean = ucat | replace: '"','' | strip %}
          {% if ba_sorted_cats_json != '' %}{% assign ba_sorted_cats_json = ba_sorted_cats_json | append: ',' %}{% endif %}
          {% assign ba_sorted_cats_json = ba_sorted_cats_json | append: '"' | append: cat_clean | append: '"' %}
        {% endif %}
      {% endunless %}
    {% endunless %}
  {% endfor %}
{% endfor %}

{
  "attributes": [
    {
      "braze_id": "{{ braze_id | replace: '"','' }}",
      "recently_browsed_products": [
        {%- assign printed = false -%}
        {%- for item in existing_products -%}

          {%- comment -%} Skip duplicate (old entry removed; new one appended below as newest) {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- unless item.product_id == shopify_product_id -%}

            {%- comment -%} No duplicate + array at capacity: drop the oldest item {%- endcomment -%}
            {%- unless existing_products.size >= max_items and duplicate_found == false and forloop.first -%}

              {%- if printed -%},{%- endif -%}
              {
                "product_id":         "{{ item.product_id    | default: '' | replace: '"','' }}",
                "sku":                "{{ item.sku           | default: '' | replace: '"','' }}",
                "product_title":      "{{ item.product_title | default: '' | replace: '"','' }}",
                "image_url":          "{{ item.image_url     | default: '' | replace: '"','' }}",
                "url":                "{{ item.url           | default: '' | replace: '"','' }}",
                "product_type":       "{{ item.product_type  | default: '' | replace: '"','' }}",
                "quantity_available": {{ item.quantity_available | default: 0 | plus: 0 }},
                "last_viewed_at":     "{{ item.last_viewed_at | default: '' | replace: '"','' }}"
              }
              {%- assign printed = true -%}

            {%- endunless -%}
          {%- endunless -%}

        {%- endfor -%}

        {%- comment -%} Append incoming product as newest (array is oldest-first) {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if printed -%},{%- endif -%}
        {
          "product_id":         "{{ shopify_product_id                       | replace: '"','' }}",
          "sku":                "{{ canvas_entry_properties.sku | default: '' | replace: '"','' }}",
          "product_title":      "{{ product_title                             | replace: '"','' }}",
          "image_url":          "{{ image_url                                 | replace: '"','' }}",
          "url":                "{{ url                                       | replace: '"','' }}",
          "product_type":       "{{ product_type                              | replace: '"','' }}",
          "quantity_available": {{ qty }},
          "last_viewed_at":     "{{ now_iso }}"
        }
      ],
      "browse_affinity_categories": [{{ ba_sorted_cats_json }}]
    }
  ]
}
